          {
            "text": [
              {
                "type": "heading",
                "level": 3,
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": "“The revitalization, accompaniment and inspiration that have provided us since Resilience Earth have been key and fundamental pieces so that Artigas Coop, the first cooperative supermarket in Garrotxa, can be a reality.”",
                    "type": "text"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": "- Pol Espadamala, president of the Artiga Coop",
                    "type": "text"
                  }
                ]
              }
